@BASE_URL = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Register

POST {{BASE_URL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"John Doe",
    "email":"john.doe@example.com",
    "password":"password123"
}

### Login

POST {{BASE_URL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"john.doe@example.com",
    "password":"password123"
}